        "date": "2026-11-27T02:54:03Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/3645-component-library (#4249 multi-seat facts)\n\nConflicts, resolved by hand:\n- crates/app/src/schema.rs: DocumentComponent keeps library_ref (#3645)\n  and takes milling and running (#3646); DocumentComponent::new sets all\n  three to None. LibraryRef and InsertRunning both stay.\n- crates/app/src/commands/tool_assembly.rs: one with_row (main's pub\n  form, with row_law). EditDocumentComponent::new keeps the held row's\n  library link, cutter facts and running data.\n- crates/app/tests/tool_library_holders.rs: both module lists kept.\n\nNew code in this merge (asked by the #4249 PR body):\n- project::component_wire carries milling and running as optional,\n  strict keys of the v84 row (and so of a .camtools v8 row); the reader\n  applies the row law (row_refusal) to each row on file.\n- The component library refuses a row with the two keys; a sync keeps\n  the document row's own facts and running data.\n- Pinned by multi_seat_rows_and_insert_running_data_save_and_reopen_identically,\n  a_cutter_fact_on_the_wrong_row_or_an_unknown_key_refuses_the_file and\n  the_store_round_trips_and_refuses_a_bad_file_whole_by_name.\n\nRefs #3645\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
