      },
      "message": "fix(app): an edit of the #3646 facts or running data derives the tools again\n\nThe #3645 short cut skipped the derive when only the library link\nchanged, but it compared only the catalog fact and the geometry. A\ncutter-fact or running-data edit then derived nothing. It now compares\nthe whole row without the link. Pinned by\nmulti_seat::an_edit_that_breaks_a_seat_is_refused_by_the_tool_name.\n\nRefs #3645\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
