      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/3645-component-library (#4278 lathe body)\n\nConflicts: crates/app/src/schema.rs, crates/app/src/commands/tool_assembly.rs,\ncrates/app/tests/tool_library_holders.rs: keep both sides (library_ref and\nlathe_body; both doc lines). The v84 component row now saves and loads\nlathe_body (component_wire_lathe.rs, strict, row_refusal law); a sync keeps\nthe row's lathe body; the component library refuses a row or a file row\nwith a lathe body by name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
