      "message": "test(app): a turning stack's lathe body reopens identically from the v84 file\n\nPinned: a CNMG in a PCLNR row with lathe_body saves and reopens with\nthe same rows, Turning records and bodies, byte-stable; the reopened\nrows derive the same result on an edit; a corrupt lathe body refuses\nthe file by name; a library save of the row is refused by name.\nDecision entry for the #4278 merge.\n\nRefs #3645\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
